sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Rel as Release Service (TUF)
    participant CDN as CDN
    participant App as Hearth Suite Client
    actor User
    CI->>CI: build, test, SBOM, sign artifacts
    CI->>Rel: publish signed metadata + hashes
    Rel->>CDN: distribute artifacts
    App->>Rel: check latest (signed metadata)
    Rel-->>App: version + signatures
    App->>CDN: download artifact
    App->>App: verify signature + hash (TUF roots)
    App-->>User: prompt to install verified update
